  "section": "25",
  "quote": "A landlord may enter a rental unit only in accordance with section 26 or 27.",
  "reason": "Entering for a routine inspection without at least 24 hours' written notice or the tenant's consent at the time of entry is not permitted under section 26 or 27, so it violates section 25. Because the clause is inconsistent with the Act, section 4(1) makes it void."
